  "title": "关于铁路的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-002.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>002)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　解放军打到那里，我们的铁路修到那里。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　（转摘自滕××在全国铁路会议上的讲话，见《人民日报》一九四九年十月二十九日）</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-001.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/3-003.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
